   "sourceHash": "18ed51ba809bb3b0ca53f632759503f309109d4705a0cedc0b2f320ddf83a21a",
   "text": "入住 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村的 Royal Villa，在喀拉拉邦的自然风光中享受舒适、阿育吠陀与整体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
