   "sourceHash": "7fdf7efeca07ecfd42f60753e30e2d6d476d385203efc4969629e3259483fc0b",
   "text": "Kairali（喀拉拉邦）为鼻窦炎和偏头痛提供由医师指导的阿育吠陀照护，包括 Nasyam、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）等草药疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
