   "sourceHash": "b574e3de037051f6ada423823a48e36024195dd62bbedfbbccd7af7d30614eb3",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]量身定制的治疗方案既关注症状，也关注潜在因素。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
